ription\":\"Optional query parameter. Comma-separated technical indicators to compute (e.g. sma_20,rsi_14,macd,bollinger_bands). Use 'all' to request every supported indicator.\",\"examples\":[\"sma_20,rsi_14,macd\"],\"title\":\"Indicators\"},\"dataset_version\":{\"anyOf\":[{\"type\":\"string\"},{\"type\":\"null\"}],\"description\":\"Optional query parameter. Pin the content version returned by the first page; changed history returns 409.\",\"title\":\"Dataset Version\"}},\"required\":[\"base\",\"quote\"],\"additionalProperties\":false}")
